        "Reactive Payments at Scale",
        "Orchestrating Payments for the Millions"
      ],
      "notes": "Revolut keeps balances in multiple currencies and matches opposite customer flows internally, so a USD→EUR trade can offset an EUR→USD trade without touching the market. Only the leftover imbalance is pooled and sent to wholesale liquidity providers, which keeps spreads and fees very low.",
